# .liaraignore — upload filter for `liara deploy` of the Iran regional runtime
# (infra/liara-iran-runtime/). The Liara CLI prefers this file over
# .dockerignore and applies gitignore semantics, so the root .dockerignore's
# bare `brand`, `docs` and `dist` patterns would also drop nested paths such
# as apps/web-react/src/brand and break the web build. Keep this file in sync
# with infra/liara-iran-runtime/Dockerfile.dockerignore.

**/node_modules
**/.git
react
dist/**/node_modules
apps/open-trade/**
apps/terminal/node_modules
docs/assets/screenshots
*.log
.env
.env.*
